(function(payload){if(typeof applySerialChapterPayload==="function")applySerialChapterPayload(payload);else (window.SERIAL_CHAPTER_QUEUE||(window.SERIAL_CHAPTER_QUEUE=[])).push(payload);})({"id":"serial-mystery-89","book":"seventh-wharf","cn":["救援灯暂有[[scarcity|不足]]，程雾把[[scarf|围巾]]系在高处示位。有人[[sceptical|怀疑]]平台会不会继续斜，经理[[scoff|嘲笑]]，被何警官带回划线后。旧纸有[[scorch|烧焦]]边，[[scripture|圣经]]展页在[[seaside|海边的]]货签里只是[[second-hand|旧的]]材料。先认人，[[secondly|其次]]再认纸，救援员把顺序说清。三人名字不是[[secret|秘密]]：梁师傅、阿芬、小唐。栏缝的树[[seed|种子]]随水走，记录员小唐说他能看见阿芬，但中间重箱挡路。我们沿他的描述把三个点画出，不能让平台上的人只剩一个‘还有人’。","我们[[seek|寻找]]安全接回路线，经理[[seldom|很少]]听过工人的完整话。作为旧件[[seller|卖方]]，他不能再只报价。阿芬一时[[senseless|失去意识]]，医护准备接手；听音[[sensitivity|灵敏度]]不替代测量。[[sensor|传感器]]坏值已被标记，救援组用当前观测[[separate|分开]]研判，原错误页[[separately|分别地]]保存。人员[[separation|分隔]]很[[serious|严重]]，我得[[seriously|认真地]]听每句话。靠梁师傅那边的[[serpent|蛇形管]]挡住脚，能不能动由现场组检查，不由我们在岸上想出一个听起来勇敢的办法。","原记录箱[[seventeen|十七]]斤，宣传记[[seventy|七十]]套新教材，这差异正被[[severely|严重地]]海风搅乱。工人清点不分[[sex|性别]]，灯的[[shadow|影子]]落在箱边；[[shadowy|昏暗的]]空间里，程雾用[[stereo|立体声]]判断呼叫大致方向，再交现场人定位。[[shaky|摇晃的]]栏不是[[sham|假的]]危险，遮条的动作很[[shameful|可耻]]。箱下还卡着[[shampoo|洗发剂]]援助袋，真货也可被放在错误的位置。梁师傅说他脚被袋子缠住，不是困在鬼故事里。救援员记录这个具体阻碍，先让他别再硬拔。","平台[[shape|形状]]正在变，金属响很[[sharp|刺耳]]。这使注意力[[sharpen|变敏锐]]，程雾[[sharply|急促地]]叫我退开，免得投射灯架倒下来。高侧[[shelf|架]]上是工程原页箱，旧图记[[shilling|先令]]，那只是[[shipbuilding|造船]]史材料，不是别的[[shipwreck|海难]]暗号。我受了一记[[shock|震动]]，想起父亲，继而看见码头[[shopping|买东西]]的人都被带到安全处。救援组试着[[shorten|缩短]]临时通道距离，老陈只指出可用固定点，不接过不熟悉的控制。往事能使他更认真，不应使他忽然被允许指挥所有人。","一柄[[shovel|铲子]]撞开碎板，阿芬的[[shriek|尖叫]]终于响起，她清醒了，[[shrill|尖锐的]]声音比什么都好听。卖[[shrimp|虾]]的摊主搬走杂物，不让旧[[shrine|神龛]]挤窄撤离路。第一条接人通道只够一人，救援组根据各人处境安排先接阿芬。她叫别管自己，梁师傅说照他们说的做，我们还等着下班。那句话让我的肩放松些，没有谁要在受困时证明自己比别人更不值得救。岸上医护已准备，程雾逐字转述刚才的定位变化，没有为了嗓音稳定就漏掉一声颤抖。","阿芬先被带回岸，梁师傅仍在内侧，小唐到了一处临时固定的高点。原页箱还在受牵动的高架，记着实际重量与旧桩缺项，如果随架倒下，会给复核留下新的保存空白。何警官要求先人后物，记录箱当前位置与已传影像，不能为纸增加伤者。老陈站在安全边帮助递灯，却一再看旧连接梁。我知道他在想什么，先请救援负责人评估，不让那一眼变成自行上台。潮水继续升，我们必须在可用通道里接回另外两人。贺青坐在岸上，终于不再催外船的时间，却也不能把刚才的催促从录音里拿走。"],"en":["There was [[scarcity|scarcity]] of lamps. Cheng tied a [[scarf|scarf]] high as a marker. Some were [[sceptical|sceptical]] of further tilt; a manager's [[scoff|scoff]] ended beyond the line. [[scorch|Scorch]]-edged [[scripture|scripture]] exhibits were [[seaside|seaside]] [[second-hand|second-hand]] papers. People first, [[secondly|secondly]] documents, rescuers said. Names were no [[secret|secret]]: Liang, A-Fen and recorder Xiao Tang. A [[seed|seed]] floated through rail gaps. Tang could see A-Fen behind a box. We mapped three positions instead of reducing them to an anonymous cry that someone remained.","We would [[seek|seek]] safe routes. Management had [[seldom|seldom]] heard full worker accounts. A [[seller|seller]] must do more than quote prices. A-Fen briefly became [[senseless|senseless]]; medical staff prepared. Acoustic [[sensitivity|sensitivity]] replaced no measurement. Faulty [[sensor|sensor]] readings were excluded; teams would [[separate|separate]] assessments, preserving error pages [[separately|separately]]. Physical [[separation|separation]] was [[serious|serious]], demanding we listen [[seriously|seriously]]. A [[serpent|serpent]]-shaped pipe blocked Liang's foot. Moving it required onsite assessment, not an impressive amateur plan invented from shore.","The record box weighed [[seventeen|seventeen]] jin despite labels claiming [[seventy|seventy]] sets. Wind interfered [[severely|severely]]. Counts included every [[sex|sex]]. A lamp's [[shadow|shadow]] crossed a [[shadowy|shadowy]] space. Cheng used [[stereo|stereo]] sound for approximate calling direction, leaving positioning to staff. [[shaky|Shaky]] rails were no [[sham|sham]]; concealment was [[shameful|shameful]]. A real donated [[shampoo|shampoo]] bag trapped Liang's foot. He identified that specific obstacle, not a ghost story. Rescuers asked him not to wrench free, keeping his exact description within their current assessment.","Platform [[shape|shape]] changed with a [[sharp|sharp]] sound. Attention would [[sharpen|sharpen]]. Cheng [[sharply|sharply]] directed me from a tilting lamp. A [[shelf|shelf]] held engineering originals. A [[shilling|shilling]] entry belonged to [[shipbuilding|shipbuilding]] history, no secret [[shipwreck|shipwreck]] code. [[shock|Shock]] recalled Father, then I saw ordinary [[shopping|shopping]] crowds withdrawn safely. Rescuers sought to [[shorten|shorten]] a temporary passage. Chen identified known fixing points without taking unfamiliar controls. Memory demanded seriousness, not sudden authority over everyone working here.","A [[shovel|shovel]] moved fragments. A-Fen's [[shriek|shriek]] meant consciousness; her [[shrill|shrill]] voice sounded welcome. A [[shrimp|shrimp]] vendor removed clutter near a [[shrine|shrine]]. The first passage held one person; rescuers chose A-Fen by circumstance. She asked to be left. Liang told her to follow instructions: they still needed to finish work and go home. Nobody must prove less deserving of rescue. Medical staff waited. Cheng relayed every positional change, including a trembling word rather than presenting steadiness as a reason to omit it.","A-Fen reached shore. Liang remained inside; Tang reached a temporary high point. Originals stayed on a moving rack, documenting actual loads and piling omissions. He ordered people before objects and recorded transmitted images and current position. Chen helped pass lamps but kept watching an old beam. I asked the rescue leader to assess it before that glance became personal action. The remaining two must return within available routes. Ashore, He Qing stopped urging departure, but could not remove earlier urgency from the recording."]});
